Hello,

Please contact us regarding the recently returned payments. At this time, we have not heard back from you and we would like to partner with you ensure the account remains in good standing. Please let us know if payments will clear moving forward and if we will be able to catch up the now past due payments that have been returned. If not, please reach out to us so we can help find a solution to keep your account current.


Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

